      "content": "HIGH STEEET 1. 5252                                                 (Rest Side)                                                      No 60 TL 0507 1/50                   20.12.67 II                             GV                    2. Late C16 or early C17, with later alterations.  Stucco on timber framework.  Old tiled roof, gabled on right over exposed timber framework.  2 storeys, 3 triple light Yorkshire casement windows and 1 sash window.  Small modern ground floor windows. Nos 48 to 88 (even); Nos 94 to 100 (even) and Barn in garden of Nos 62 and 64 form a group. Listing NGR: TL0550607901"
